# Design System - Jetpack Compose

Todo componente debe usar `MaterialTheme` para colores, tipografía y shapes. **Nunca valores "al aire"**.

## Shapes

```kotlin
// ❌ MAL - Valores hardcodeados sin contexto
shape = RoundedCornerShape(12.dp)
shape = RoundedCornerShape(50.dp)

// ✅ BIEN - Usa MaterialTheme.shapes
shape = MaterialTheme.shapes.medium      // 12.dp - Cards, dialogs
shape = MaterialTheme.shapes.extraLarge  // 50.dp - Botones pill
shape = MaterialTheme.shapes.small       // 8.dp - Chips
```

## Colores

```kotlin
// ❌ MAL - Colores hardcodeados
color = Color(0xFF1EC691)
color = Color.White

// ✅ BIEN - Usa MaterialTheme.colorScheme
color = MaterialTheme.colorScheme.primary
color = MaterialTheme.colorScheme.surface
color = MaterialTheme.colorScheme.onSurface

// ✅ ACEPTABLE - Colores custom del theme (Color.kt)
color = LightGreen  // Definido en theme/Color.kt
color = GreenSelected
```

## Tipografía

```kotlin
// ❌ MAL - Estilos inline
fontSize = 16.sp
fontWeight = FontWeight.Bold

// ✅ BIEN - Usa MaterialTheme.typography
style = MaterialTheme.typography.bodyLarge
style = MaterialTheme.typography.titleMedium
style = MaterialTheme.typography.labelMedium
```

## Dimensiones (Espaciado/Tamaños)

```kotlin
// ✅ ACEPTABLE - Valores directos .dp (no hay Dimens object)
.padding(16.dp)
.size(24.dp)
.height(56.dp)

// ⚠️ CONSISTENCIA - Usar múltiplos de 4dp
4.dp, 8.dp, 12.dp, 16.dp, 24.dp, 32.dp, 48.dp, 56.dp
```

## Escala de Shapes (GoodLifeShapes)

| Shape | Valor | Uso |
|-------|-------|-----|
| `extraSmall` | 4.dp | Badges, indicadores |
| `small` | 8.dp | Chips, campos pequeños |
| `medium` | 12.dp | Cards, dialogs |
| `large` | 16.dp | Bottom sheets |
| `extraLarge` | 50.dp | Botones pill, inputs |
